You can understand the wonder of what 's happened .

1040
00:59:15,969 --> 00:59:17,255
Now just think .

1041
00:59:17,470 --> 00:59:19,052
Less than a month ago Santa Mira

1042
00:59:19,263 --> 00:59:20,379
