1052
00:59:47,250 --> 00:59:51,711
They 're taking you over cell for cell atom for atom .

1053
00:59:51,921 --> 00:59:52,877
There 's no pain .

1054
00:59:54,257 --> 00:59:55,964
Suddenly , while you 're asleep

1055
