1222
01:18:06,973 --> 01:18:07,838
You 're next .

1223
01:18:08,975 --> 01:18:10,011
You 're next .

1224
01:18:10,227 --> 01:18:11,559
You 're next .

1225
01:18:11,770 --> 01:18:13,181
You 're next .

1226
01:18:13,396 --> 01:18:14,261
You 're next .

1227
